Delight in spilling the blood of your foes.  After scoring a critical hit, your maximum hit points will be increased by [3%, 6%, 9%, 10%, 12% (TL1-5)], your life regeneration by [1.70, 2.81, 3.65, 4.37, 5.00 (TL1-5)] per turn, and your stamina regeneration by [0.34, 0.56, 0.73, 0.87, 1.00 (TL1-5)] per turn for [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] turns.

The life and stamina regeneration will stack up to five times, for a maximum of [8.50, 14, 18, 22, 25 (TL1-5)] and [1.70, 2.81, 3.65, 4.37, 5.00 (TL1-5)] each turn, respectively.
